    "title": "Fictio - Good Novels, Stories",
    "description": "Discover an extensive collection of exclusive fiction across genres such as History, Action, Fantasy, Young Adult, Adventure, General, Paranormal, Poetry, Science Fiction, Werewolf Romance, Classic, Humor, Suspense, All Horror, and Spiritual Non-Fiction.\r\n\r\nShare your stories and build your fanbase. Join thousands of aspiring authors on Fictio, available in over 50 countries with national and international bestsellers in various languages. With a subscription, enjoy unlimited access to an ever-expanding library of audiobooks, e-books, and podcasts.\r\n\r\nIn-app subscriptions are billed through iTunes. Your subscription auto-renews monthly or annually, unless you deactivate it 24 hours before the current period ends. Free trial subscriptions require payment details but won't charge if canceled before the last free day.\r\n\r\nContent, language, and subscription models may vary by region.\r\n\r\nOur authors are associated with platforms like Wattpad, Webtoon, Kindle, Episode, Podcast, Book, Momox, Dream, French Goodreads, Histoire, Delitoon, Piccoma Cultura, Coran en Francais Pearltrees.\r\n\r\nExplore an infinite array of original content beyond platforms like Wattpad, Webtoon, Kindle, Episode, Podcast, Book, Momox, Dream, French Goodreads, Histoire, Delitoon, Piccoma, Cultura, Coran en Francais Pearltrees.\r\n\r\nCheck out our terms and conditions:\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.fictioapp.com/privacy-policy.html\r\nTerms and Conditions: https://www.fictioapp.com/terms-conditions.html\r\n\r\nHave questions or suggestions? Reach out to us at support@novelmonkey.app.",
